WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 07]

01:43.979 --> 01:45.380
It's almost a month away.

01:46.060 --> 01:48.190
I wonder if Lu Li has figured it out yet.

01:57.060 --> 01:58.030
Senior Bai Feng.

01:59.460 --> 02:00.390
Why are you here?

02:01.620 --> 02:02.680
Why can't I be here?

02:03.380 --> 02:04.510
I'm closer to Lu Li

02:04.940 --> 02:06.870
than you think.

02:12.260 --> 02:13.060
He's resting.

02:13.300 --> 02:14.660
I don't think it's a good time for you

02:14.660 --> 02:15.460
to go in there.

02:19.940 --> 02:20.470
Liu Shao.

02:22.380 --> 02:24.420
Everyone in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion knows that

02:24.420 --> 02:26.340
you are in conflict with his spiritual power.

02:26.340 --> 02:27.590
You were born to be

02:27.590 --> 02:29.070
the malefic of his life.

02:29.860 --> 02:30.950
Think about it.

02:31.530 --> 02:32.430
You

02:32.980 --> 02:34.750
only knows buy him off.

02:35.530 --> 02:37.270
Once you're no longer useful,

02:37.540 --> 02:39.800
he will not hesitate to leave you behind.

02:40.579 --> 02:41.240
He's

02:41.740 --> 02:43.760
such a cold and greedy man.

02:49.610 --> 02:50.110
Senior.

02:50.980 --> 02:51.780
Although Lu Li always

02:51.780 --> 02:53.230
talks about money,

02:53.780 --> 02:55.910
he wears the cheapest fabric,

02:56.579 --> 02:58.980
and eats the cheapest food when he eats out.

02:59.460 --> 03:01.460
He kept the money he had saved in his pocket

03:01.460 --> 03:02.950
and was reluctant to spend it.

03:02.950 --> 03:03.620
Although I don't know

03:03.620 --> 03:05.260
why he hides

03:05.260 --> 03:06.060
his true self,

03:07.250 --> 03:08.270
my father told me

03:08.730 --> 03:09.820
you can't judge a man

03:09.820 --> 03:12.280
by his appearance. You need to see his heart.

03:12.540 --> 03:13.430
So I trust him.

03:13.900 --> 03:16.829
I don't believe he's the man you say he is.

03:18.140 --> 03:20.940
I can't believe Liu Shao would defend me like that.

03:21.220 --> 03:22.000
Silly girl.

03:22.420 --> 03:24.020
I'm looking out for you here.

03:24.490 --> 03:26.110
If something goes wrong,

03:26.540 --> 03:28.470
don't blame me for not warning you.

03:30.579 --> 03:32.110
I appreciate your efforts.

03:32.340 --> 03:35.240
I still remember the time

03:35.579 --> 03:37.860
when you brought Du Mingchong to the Pearl Pavilion

03:37.860 --> 03:39.520
and put a sword around my neck.

03:56.780 --> 03:57.840
Liu Shao trusts me.

03:58.300 --> 03:59.510
I can't let her down.

04:00.740 --> 04:03.670
I must help her find the King Herb as soon as possible.

04:21.260 --> 04:21.790
Liu Shao.

04:31.340 --> 04:32.200
What happened?

04:33.300 --> 04:35.300
You don't want to find the King Herb?

04:37.810 --> 04:39.430
You've figured it out?

04:40.460 --> 04:43.070
Well, it's not really a solution.

04:44.100 --> 04:45.240
But at this time,

04:45.580 --> 04:48.060
we can only go to the Pearl Pavilion to find him,

04:48.060 --> 04:48.950
to use some

04:49.420 --> 04:50.750
very unusual measures.

04:55.590 --> 04:58.030
[Pearl Pavilion]

04:58.740 --> 04:59.550
Shut up.

05:03.420 --> 05:04.270
You kicked me?

05:04.740 --> 05:05.660
Behave yourself.

05:05.660 --> 05:06.320
Don't move.

05:06.700 --> 05:07.360
Don't move.

05:19.780 --> 05:21.360
Master of Herbs, right?

05:23.300 --> 05:25.560
You let us play with you every day, right?

05:26.570 --> 05:27.700
And you won't tell us

05:27.700 --> 05:29.040
how to grow the King Herb, right?

05:29.040 --> 05:29.470
Right?

05:43.860 --> 05:44.909
Now,

05:44.909 --> 05:46.170
I give you two choices.

05:46.420 --> 05:47.550
Two choices.

05:49.050 --> 05:49.590
First.

05:50.060 --> 05:50.580
First.

05:50.580 --> 05:51.310
Hush.

05:57.180 --> 05:57.840
First.

05:57.840 --> 05:58.560
First.

05:58.560 --> 05:59.330
Give us the King Herb.

05:59.330 --> 05:59.930
King Herb.

06:00.260 --> 06:00.800
Second.

06:00.800 --> 06:01.690
Second.

06:01.690 --> 06:03.070
Can you stop talking?

06:04.260 --> 06:04.670
Okay.

06:07.660 --> 06:08.670
Well, second.

06:09.300 --> 06:10.750
Give us the King Herb.

06:10.750 --> 06:11.950
Give us the King Herb.

06:14.780 --> 06:15.760
Otherwise...

06:18.890 --> 06:20.830
I'm gonna cook you right now.

06:23.660 --> 06:24.400
Think of a way

06:25.810 --> 06:27.590
to keep you alive

06:27.590 --> 06:28.800
and give us the King Herb.

06:28.800 --> 06:29.600
That's right.

06:35.140 --> 06:36.670
What are you talking about?

06:37.140 --> 06:38.140
What are you talking about?

06:38.140 --> 06:39.000
What did he say?

06:39.490 --> 06:40.220
I can't hear you.

06:40.220 --> 06:40.830
Louder.

06:49.460 --> 06:50.780
How dare you two little bastards

06:50.780 --> 06:51.550
do this to me?

06:51.860 --> 06:52.720
I'm telling you.

06:52.720 --> 06:53.510
You can't

06:53.860 --> 06:55.030
get spiritual power

06:55.500 --> 06:56.960
from eating the King Herb.

06:56.980 --> 06:58.560
I've lived in the Pearl Pavilion

06:58.560 --> 06:59.890
for thousands of years.

07:00.180 --> 07:01.540
I don't bow down to anyone.

07:01.540 --> 07:02.850
Eat, eat as you please!

07:02.850 --> 07:03.910
Choke you to death!

07:05.400 --> 07:06.830
He's a little arrogant?

07:07.180 --> 07:08.710
And he doesn't bow his head?

07:09.260 --> 07:09.790
Liu Shao.

07:12.580 --> 07:13.040
Come on.

07:14.580 --> 07:15.110
Come on.

07:19.100 --> 07:20.700
You! You! What are you doing?

07:21.220 --> 07:22.430
What are you doing?

07:22.430 --> 07:24.720
Take a guess. Don't move.

07:24.720 --> 07:25.720
Behave yourself.

07:33.220 --> 07:34.220
Give it back to me!

07:36.659 --> 07:39.870
This hairpin looks familiar.

07:41.020 --> 07:41.750
Remember?

07:42.420 --> 07:43.710
This is the one

07:44.060 --> 07:46.520
from the portrait in the "Magic Plant Code".

07:48.180 --> 07:48.750
Right.

07:49.060 --> 07:50.820
The beauty in the painting

07:50.820 --> 07:51.940
wore

07:51.940 --> 07:54.270
this hairpin.

07:54.270 --> 07:55.530
Was she right, master?

07:56.580 --> 07:57.510
I'm telling you.

07:58.380 --> 08:00.000
How dare you two do this to me?

08:00.900 --> 08:03.030
If there's any damage to this hairpin,

08:03.530 --> 08:05.930
I'll keep you from seeing the sun tomorrow.

08:09.580 --> 08:10.640
Is he really angry?

08:20.700 --> 08:21.980
Master,

08:21.980 --> 08:22.710
actually,

08:23.490 --> 08:25.750
we don't want to push you like this, okay?

08:27.260 --> 08:28.390
We couldn't help it.

08:28.980 --> 08:30.470
We're at the end of our tether.

08:30.470 --> 08:32.130
If we can't find the King Herb,

08:32.299 --> 08:33.320
you really want Liu Shao out

08:33.320 --> 08:34.520
to feed the demons?

08:34.520 --> 08:36.169
Yes, I can't beat Ao Hen.

08:36.169 --> 08:37.789
And I can't run away.

08:38.100 --> 08:38.990
You can't just

08:39.299 --> 08:40.559
let this happen.

08:42.980 --> 08:44.780
Actually, there're some things

08:45.180 --> 08:47.220
that you can't do with your best efforts.

08:47.220 --> 08:47.950
For example?

08:49.380 --> 08:50.110
For example,

08:50.860 --> 08:52.990
if you can help me out of the Pearl Pavilion,

08:52.990 --> 08:54.220
I'll give you the King Herb.

08:54.220 --> 08:55.220
What do you think?

08:56.060 --> 08:56.660
That's it?

08:58.820 --> 08:59.270
Deal.

09:00.620 --> 09:02.340
But you have to let us know

09:02.340 --> 09:04.470
how you got in here, right?

09:05.980 --> 09:06.830
It happened

09:08.500 --> 09:10.630
because I was too kind.

09:13.930 --> 09:15.010
A thousand years ago,

09:15.010 --> 09:17.270
I was bored, so I came to the mortal world.

09:17.580 --> 09:19.380
There was nothing interesting.

09:23.100 --> 09:25.590
And I saw her in the moonlight.

09:25.980 --> 09:28.030
She seemed to have something on her mind.

09:28.030 --> 09:29.870
This scene caught my eye at once.

09:42.020 --> 09:42.590
Miss!

09:52.100 --> 09:53.390
Miss. Miss.

09:53.980 --> 09:54.870
Miss, wake up.

09:55.180 --> 09:55.560
Miss.

09:56.140 --> 09:56.510
Miss.

09:57.340 --> 09:58.110
Wake up.

09:58.380 --> 09:58.790
Miss.

10:02.300 --> 10:04.550
Why do you want to die?

10:07.540 --> 10:08.470
You want to know?

10:11.740 --> 10:13.620
You can meet me at the Pearl Pavilion

10:13.620 --> 10:14.980
between 1 p.m. and 2 p.m. tomorrow afternoon.

10:14.980 --> 10:16.470
I'll tell you my story.

10:17.340 --> 10:18.270
Pearl Pavilion?

10:22.180 --> 10:22.780
By the way,

10:23.140 --> 10:24.470
my name is Ling Xueyang.

10:25.740 --> 10:26.680
Ling Xueyang?

10:27.940 --> 10:29.200
This girl is so pretty.

10:29.380 --> 10:30.910
And she has a nice name, too.

10:31.700 --> 10:33.950
Looks like heaven really heard my call.

10:34.300 --> 10:35.830
I not only met interesting things,

10:35.830 --> 10:37.490
but also interesting people.

10:44.140 --> 10:45.400
How can you be smiling?

10:46.140 --> 10:47.190
Of course I can.

10:47.500 --> 10:49.360
That was a hero saving the beauty,

10:49.460 --> 10:51.470
beautiful as a fairy tale.

10:51.470 --> 10:52.670
According to legend,

10:52.700 --> 10:54.070
there was

10:54.200 --> 10:55.900
a very outstanding female Marquis Wuyang,

10:55.900 --> 10:57.030
named Ling Xueyang.

10:57.700 --> 10:59.350
Marquis Wuyang

10:59.620 --> 11:01.830
jumped into the river and killed herself?

11:01.830 --> 11:02.720
And she happened to be saved

11:02.720 --> 11:04.680
by you?

11:05.260 --> 11:06.040
So what?

11:06.040 --> 11:06.910
Anyway,

11:06.910 --> 11:08.630
this... this... this was a good start!

11:08.630 --> 11:09.260
Okay, okay, okay.

11:09.260 --> 11:09.920
Have a seat.

11:10.100 --> 11:10.710
Okay, okay, okay.

11:10.710 --> 11:11.480
A good start.

11:12.180 --> 11:13.390
Did you go on your date?

11:13.390 --> 11:13.950
Did you?

11:14.660 --> 11:15.590
Of course.

11:16.420 --> 11:18.020
But it didn't occur to me that

11:18.060 --> 11:19.790
I wouldn't be able to come back.

11:27.770 --> 11:29.350
Ling Xueyang, I'm coming!

12:10.100 --> 12:10.880
Ling Xueyang.

12:10.880 --> 12:11.810
What do you mean?

12:14.140 --> 12:15.190
By the way,

12:15.500 --> 12:16.030
I,

12:16.380 --> 12:17.230
Ling Xueyang,

12:17.210 --> 12:20.820
[Ling Xueyang, female Marquis Wuyang]

12:17.740 --> 12:19.470
am the current Marquis Wuyang,

12:19.500 --> 12:21.190
the Lord of the human world.

12:22.340 --> 12:23.270
Marquis Wuyang?

12:24.300 --> 12:27.260
So throwing yourself in the lake and killing yourself

12:27.260 --> 12:29.580
were deliberate attempts to get close to me?

12:29.580 --> 12:31.240
What exactly do you want to do?

12:31.340 --> 12:32.550
I want your King Herb.

12:36.260 --> 12:36.990
I don't have.

12:38.900 --> 12:39.880
If not,

12:45.220 --> 12:46.110
you can stay.

12:47.500 --> 12:48.630
I don't care.

12:49.590 --> 12:51.460
Let's see which one of us can outlive the other.

12:51.460 --> 12:52.660
But you can't stew me.

12:55.940 --> 12:56.630
In this way,

12:57.690 --> 12:59.590
I was left by Xueyang in the Pearl Pavilion.

12:58.830 --> 13:01.560
[Pearl Pavilion]

13:02.660 --> 13:05.060
She spent her days at the pavilion reading papers

13:05.060 --> 13:06.780
and dealing with official businesses.

13:06.780 --> 13:08.240
She didn't even look at me.

13:09.980 --> 13:10.950
I was bored

13:11.570 --> 13:12.630
with her every day.

13:12.860 --> 13:14.590
So I couldn't help teasing her.

13:17.620 --> 13:18.420
She ignored me

13:19.100 --> 13:20.100
and was not angry.

13:24.420 --> 13:25.590
Gradually,

13:26.100 --> 13:27.900
I got used to the Pearl Pavilion,

13:28.660 --> 13:30.660
and got used to be with her every day.

13:32.140 --> 13:33.110
Until one night,

13:33.740 --> 13:35.270
I woke up and didn't see her.

13:42.900 --> 13:45.030
For thousands of years of loneliness,

13:45.900 --> 13:47.960
I felt this warmth for the first time.

13:49.140 --> 13:50.470
I didn't know since when

13:51.020 --> 13:53.660
I looked forward to seeing her every second of the day,

13:53.660 --> 13:54.720
accompanying her.

13:55.890 --> 13:57.400
She was still cold

13:58.060 --> 13:58.920
and unsmiling.

14:00.260 --> 14:02.920
But gradually we began to care about each other.

14:35.980 --> 14:36.920
My life

14:37.660 --> 14:39.440
had never been so peaceful

14:39.740 --> 14:40.630
and happy.

14:41.860 --> 14:42.720
Because of her,

14:43.540 --> 14:45.120
I became a real person,

14:45.940 --> 14:47.750
not just a herb.

14:49.490 --> 14:50.820
And then what happened?

14:50.940 --> 14:52.070
She died?

14:53.620 --> 14:54.380
Hey.

14:54.380 --> 14:55.380
Watch your mouth.

14:55.620 --> 14:56.620
Okay, okay, okay.

14:57.340 --> 14:59.360
Our master

14:59.360 --> 15:01.420
just took advantage of his long life.

15:01.660 --> 15:02.910
Was she dead?

15:03.340 --> 15:04.740
How can you talk this way?

15:04.940 --> 15:05.950
Actually,

15:06.420 --> 15:07.350
I'm worried that

15:07.700 --> 15:09.430
mortal life is too short.

15:10.740 --> 15:12.750
I was ready to give her the herb.

15:30.220 --> 15:30.870
Do you know

15:32.020 --> 15:33.950
why I want your herb?

15:36.700 --> 15:38.760
Because I want to draw the Moon Sword.

15:40.260 --> 15:42.510
I want the greatest power in the world.

15:44.460 --> 15:45.440
I want mortals

15:45.940 --> 15:48.540
to live righteously between heaven and earth,

15:48.820 --> 15:50.480
no longer be bullied by demons

15:51.420 --> 15:53.750
and no longer be restrained by immortals.

15:54.020 --> 15:55.620
And we wouldn't be like this.

15:57.260 --> 15:58.580
Without the help of immortals,

15:58.580 --> 16:01.380
I can't even deal with a drought-causing monster.

16:02.060 --> 16:03.310
At that moment,

16:03.780 --> 16:05.580
I wanted to give her the King Herb

16:05.660 --> 16:06.990
to reassure her.

16:08.740 --> 16:09.940
But

16:09.940 --> 16:11.350
I hesitated.

16:12.020 --> 16:13.590
This moment of hesitation

16:14.300 --> 16:16.350
has become our eternal farewell.

16:25.420 --> 16:26.950
Don't open it until I leave.

16:55.460 --> 16:56.710
And then?

17:00.740 --> 17:01.600
What happened?

17:04.810 --> 17:05.810
Legend has it that

17:06.619 --> 17:08.640
Ling Xueyang died with that monster

17:08.640 --> 17:10.430
in the great war.

17:11.500 --> 17:13.069
It snowed for three days.

17:13.619 --> 17:15.950
And the people wept for her for three days.

17:17.210 --> 17:19.140
According to historical records,

17:19.220 --> 17:21.349
heaven pitied her love for the people,

17:21.619 --> 17:24.030
so it snowed for three days for her funeral.

17:52.020 --> 17:54.000
If only I had given her the herb

17:54.580 --> 17:57.160
and helped her draw the Moon Sword.

18:02.260 --> 18:02.910
Master,

18:03.500 --> 18:04.280
don't be sad.

18:04.280 --> 18:05.030
Yes.

18:05.500 --> 18:08.430
I'm sure Ling Xueyang would hate to see you like this.

18:10.020 --> 18:10.790
Let's go.

18:11.300 --> 18:12.560
Let's leave him alone.

18:20.180 --> 18:21.990
Let's not push him.

18:22.300 --> 18:24.420
I didn't expect him to live 10,000 years

18:24.420 --> 18:26.150
and still have a past like this.

18:28.940 --> 18:30.870
Even if he doesn't give us the herb,

18:31.100 --> 18:32.830
let's get him out.

18:35.460 --> 18:35.990
Liu Shao.

18:37.020 --> 18:38.080
Did you ever wonder

18:38.300 --> 18:40.500
why Ling Xueyang gave him that hairpin?

18:41.620 --> 18:44.410
Did Ling Xueyang feel that she couldn't come back,

18:44.410 --> 18:46.270
so she used this to show her heart?

18:47.380 --> 18:48.670
It's possible.

18:49.140 --> 18:51.340
But I don't think that's what she meant.

18:51.700 --> 18:54.760
The hairpin may have something to do with the boundary.

18:55.580 --> 18:57.710
Ling Xueyang knew she was going to die.

18:58.180 --> 18:59.260
How could she

18:59.260 --> 19:02.390
keep her sweetheart imprisoned for thousands of years?

19:04.740 --> 19:05.880
But this hairpin

19:06.300 --> 19:08.020
was supposed to be the only memento

19:08.020 --> 19:09.440
of Ling Xueyang.

19:12.460 --> 19:13.660
Even if we get him out,

19:13.900 --> 19:15.030
it's not gonna help.

19:16.420 --> 19:17.820
What really held him back

19:18.140 --> 19:20.070
was his feelings for Ling Xueyang.

19:22.260 --> 19:23.430
So,

19:24.300 --> 19:27.160
we don't have much chance of getting the herb, do we?

19:36.620 --> 19:37.150
Lu Li.

19:39.060 --> 19:40.390
If I get kicked out,

19:41.620 --> 19:42.820
will you stand with me

19:43.500 --> 19:45.470
to face Ao Hen?

19:48.260 --> 19:50.260
I don't know how far I can go with you.

19:51.140 --> 19:52.270
But I will do my best

19:53.060 --> 19:54.460
to accompany you to go on.

19:54.940 --> 19:55.470
Liu Shao.

19:56.300 --> 19:58.630
I can actually relate to Ling Xueyang now,

19:59.980 --> 20:01.240
drawing the Moon Sword

20:01.420 --> 20:02.550
to get strong power,

20:03.700 --> 20:06.760
so you can protect the people you're trying to protect.

20:15.540 --> 20:16.230
From now on,

20:17.060 --> 20:18.900
I'll stand with you in the face of anyone

20:18.900 --> 20:19.710
and anything.

20:21.050 --> 20:21.990
I hope one day

20:22.860 --> 20:24.860
I can be strong enough to protect you

20:25.620 --> 20:28.350
from anyone and anything.

20:33.100 --> 20:33.670
Lu Li.

20:36.410 --> 20:37.080
Thank you.

21:14.420 --> 21:15.390
Ao Hen!

21:15.740 --> 21:16.630
Come out!

21:45.380 --> 21:48.590
You don't look like a daredevil.

21:48.860 --> 21:52.070
Don't you dare come and yell at me.

21:52.070 --> 21:53.150
I see

21:54.340 --> 21:55.680
you've figured it out.

21:56.740 --> 21:57.510
Ao Hen,

21:57.510 --> 21:59.110
I want to make a deal with you.

21:59.380 --> 21:59.990
Will you?

22:00.940 --> 22:02.050
You?

22:02.050 --> 22:03.850
What qualifications do you have

22:04.540 --> 22:06.670
to make this deal with me?

22:08.060 --> 22:09.380
I'm certainly no match for you

22:09.380 --> 22:10.390
in strength.

22:11.460 --> 22:13.660
But I know you've been chasing someone.

22:14.780 --> 22:16.240
I can help you get Liu Shao.

22:19.300 --> 22:19.950
Okay.

22:20.780 --> 22:22.070
I wonder

22:22.540 --> 22:23.630
what you

22:24.020 --> 22:25.510
really want.

22:25.980 --> 22:27.040
I want to be strong,

22:28.100 --> 22:29.310
like you.

22:32.220 --> 22:33.800
Tell me

22:33.800 --> 22:36.840
how strong I am.

22:37.140 --> 22:39.630
You can ask for anything you want,

22:40.100 --> 22:41.360
without asking anyone

22:41.410 --> 22:43.410
and caring whether he agrees or not.

22:46.620 --> 22:47.470
All right.

22:48.500 --> 22:52.170
I'll grant your request.

22:52.170 --> 22:53.350
Tell me.

22:54.140 --> 22:55.710
What exactly do you want?

23:03.540 --> 23:05.100
Every year, banishing demons on the Double Ninth Festival

23:05.100 --> 23:06.900
is a top priority in the mansion.

23:07.340 --> 23:08.830
The weather is dry these days

23:08.830 --> 23:10.140
and it's easy to catch fire.

23:10.140 --> 23:11.400
Be careful, all of you.

23:11.620 --> 23:13.720
No place in this mansion

23:13.720 --> 23:14.780
can be left behind.

23:15.050 --> 23:15.510
Yes.

23:16.900 --> 23:17.500
Wang Jian.

23:18.460 --> 23:19.060
Come here.

23:22.220 --> 23:23.680
Why isn't Lu Li here again?

23:23.940 --> 23:24.770
What did he do

23:24.770 --> 23:25.830
while we were busy?

23:26.140 --> 23:27.720
Does he have eyes for me?

23:28.860 --> 23:30.000
Senior, calm down.

23:30.660 --> 23:31.690
The Lord and Captain Fang

23:31.690 --> 23:34.100
went to Moon Washing Pond to check out the demon realm.

23:34.100 --> 23:35.080
Senior Lu Li

23:35.080 --> 23:36.720
was so busy patrolling the place

23:36.720 --> 23:38.150
and trying to get hold of the herb

23:38.150 --> 23:40.010
that he really had his hands full.

23:40.660 --> 23:42.870
Can he really get that King Herb?

23:43.620 --> 23:44.820
He already has a clue.

23:45.090 --> 23:47.290
Now it's just a matter of when he gets it.

23:48.620 --> 23:49.420
You may leave.

24:07.500 --> 24:08.150
Senior Du,

24:08.660 --> 24:09.550
what I promised

24:09.860 --> 24:11.110
will be done.

24:11.940 --> 24:14.270
It's just that if you cover it up like this,

24:14.460 --> 24:16.060
it makes people suspicious.

24:16.940 --> 24:17.590
Bai Feng.

24:17.900 --> 24:19.000
Is it accurate that

24:19.000 --> 24:20.980
there's an immortal herb that has grown fine for thousands of years

24:20.980 --> 24:22.670
in the Pearl Pavilion?

24:23.260 --> 24:24.960
I hope it doesn't backfire.

24:24.960 --> 24:28.230
I don't want it to affect our future in the mansion.

24:30.660 --> 24:31.430
Senior Du.

24:31.980 --> 24:34.370
Today's Marquis Wuyang practiced martial arts at the age of three,

24:34.370 --> 24:35.930
and achieved enlightenment at the age of ten.

24:35.930 --> 24:38.220
He defended justice with a three-foot sword.

24:38.220 --> 24:40.660
He was chosen to be the Lord

24:40.660 --> 24:42.100
at the age of 16 by the former Marquis Wuyang.

24:42.100 --> 24:43.160
In order to be strong,

24:43.160 --> 24:44.230
he would

24:44.660 --> 24:45.590
stop at nothing.

24:46.580 --> 24:47.630
I thought

24:48.020 --> 24:49.870
you would be a lot like the master,

24:49.870 --> 24:51.790
resourceful and courageous.

24:52.330 --> 24:53.070
Now,

24:53.500 --> 24:55.830
why have you become so timid?

24:57.060 --> 24:59.320
How can I not believe what you say?

24:59.620 --> 25:01.100
It's just that this is very important,

25:01.100 --> 25:02.500
and I want to be discreet.

25:02.940 --> 25:04.460
Who would have thought that

25:04.460 --> 25:05.410
such a secret could be hidden

25:05.410 --> 25:07.270
in that deserted Pearl Pavilion?

25:09.570 --> 25:11.870
It's a good thing you told me before.

25:12.340 --> 25:14.600
Otherwise, if Lu Li offers the King Herb,

25:14.700 --> 25:15.860
I'm afraid

25:15.860 --> 25:18.060
there's no place for me in this mansion.

25:19.940 --> 25:21.360
I'm glad you understand.

25:22.020 --> 25:24.460
I will do the rest myself.

25:24.460 --> 25:27.040
All you need to do is

25:27.460 --> 25:29.820
distract brothers and sisters from the Pearl Pavilion.

25:29.820 --> 25:32.030
If it works, you can take the credit.

25:32.860 --> 25:33.520
If it fails,

25:34.060 --> 25:35.680
I won't drag you down.

25:37.340 --> 25:39.440
I do appreciate your efforts.

25:40.020 --> 25:42.430
When I control Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

25:43.140 --> 25:45.320
I'll repay you.

25:48.540 --> 25:49.550
Well, I got to go.

26:10.100 --> 26:12.560
I'd like to ask you to borrow some demon fire,

26:13.260 --> 26:15.230
which can burn for seven days.

26:16.860 --> 26:17.590
Okay.

26:18.900 --> 26:19.960
I'll give it to you.

26:35.260 --> 26:37.950
This demon fire only burns living things.

26:38.260 --> 26:39.830
And it won't burn out.

26:40.460 --> 26:43.110
Make good use of it.

26:55.740 --> 26:56.270
Liu Shao!

26:59.060 --> 26:59.990
Senior Bai Feng.

27:01.500 --> 27:02.370
Usually,

27:02.370 --> 27:04.420
you are responsible for cleaning the Pearl Pavilion.

27:04.420 --> 27:05.820
Then you're gonna have to

27:05.940 --> 27:08.400
take care of these demon-banishing lights.

27:08.860 --> 27:09.310
Yes.

27:10.940 --> 27:12.740
I'm afraid it's not that simple.

27:13.220 --> 27:14.620
I have to be more careful.

27:16.100 --> 27:16.800
But...

27:16.800 --> 27:19.070
Not many people go to the Pearl Pavilion normally.

27:19.070 --> 27:20.630
Do we need so many lights?

27:21.730 --> 27:23.950
Because no one usually goes there.

27:24.220 --> 27:26.320
What if some demons

27:26.320 --> 27:27.110
go in there?

27:27.540 --> 27:28.600
Junior Liu Shao.

27:28.600 --> 27:30.160
Am I right?

27:31.100 --> 27:32.870
Yes, you're right.

27:32.870 --> 27:33.670
I'll go.

27:48.700 --> 27:49.470
Master!

27:50.860 --> 27:51.710
Master!

27:53.660 --> 27:55.420
We're not going to ask you for the herb anymore.

27:55.420 --> 27:57.020
You need to stop avoiding me.

27:59.060 --> 27:59.750
Come out!

28:03.900 --> 28:04.550
All right.

28:05.940 --> 28:07.100
I'll clean up

28:07.100 --> 28:08.270
and leave you alone.

28:11.180 --> 28:12.630
Girl, why don't you eat?

28:13.380 --> 28:14.620
Is your nose not working

28:14.620 --> 28:16.820
or these osmanthus cakes aren't sweet?

28:17.540 --> 28:19.200
Because I want to eat with you.

28:19.620 --> 28:20.540
Little girl,

28:20.540 --> 28:22.540
since when do you have a conscience?

28:22.540 --> 28:23.400
What happened?

28:23.540 --> 28:24.620
This year's demon-banishing,

28:24.620 --> 28:26.540
you even counted the Pearl Pavilion?

28:26.540 --> 28:27.540
When I do the math,

28:27.780 --> 28:28.990
no one has visited the Pearl Pavilion

28:28.990 --> 28:30.230
for nearly a century.

28:32.460 --> 28:34.560
Master, you mean

28:34.560 --> 28:36.900
they didn't come to the Pearl Pavilion in the past?

28:36.900 --> 28:37.790
No, no, no.

28:38.140 --> 28:40.140
I scared them off when they got here.

28:40.740 --> 28:42.410
I don't know what's going on this year,

28:42.410 --> 28:44.670
with all these demon-banishing lights.

28:49.340 --> 28:50.140
What's wrong?

28:53.900 --> 28:55.700
Aren't you the one who laid them out?

28:55.700 --> 28:56.760
Is there a problem?

29:21.420 --> 29:23.110
Demon fire! Run! Run!

29:33.690 --> 29:34.190
Xue.

29:34.620 --> 29:35.620
Where is Liu Shao?

29:35.740 --> 29:36.780
Senior Bai Feng asked her

29:36.780 --> 29:38.380
to lay out the demon-banishing lights in the Pearl Pavilion.

29:38.380 --> 29:39.580
She's still not back.

29:39.620 --> 29:40.240
Bai Feng?

29:44.140 --> 29:45.500
How long has she been gone?

29:45.500 --> 29:47.310
Seems like a few hours ago.

29:48.060 --> 29:49.150
Fire!

29:49.980 --> 29:50.990
Fire!

29:50.990 --> 29:52.240
The Pearl Pavilion is on fire!

29:52.240 --> 29:52.800
Get some water.

29:52.800 --> 29:53.500
The Pearl Pavilion is on fire.

29:53.500 --> 29:54.300
Hurry up. Hurry up.

29:54.300 --> 29:55.230
Put out the fire.

30:01.140 --> 30:02.050
Why can't this fire go out?

30:02.050 --> 30:03.500
This demon fire was enchanted.

30:03.500 --> 30:05.540
Once it burns, water can't put it out. The fire will burn for seven days.

30:05.540 --> 30:06.150
Girl, run!

30:16.900 --> 30:17.780
Hurry! Hurry!

30:17.780 --> 30:18.310
Hurry up!

30:19.420 --> 30:20.260
Help! Help!

30:20.260 --> 30:20.660
Hurry up!

30:20.660 --> 30:21.190
This way!

30:21.380 --> 30:21.900
Hurry up! Hurry up!

30:21.900 --> 30:22.640
Get some water!

30:22.640 --> 30:23.270
Hurry!

30:23.270 --> 30:24.190
Get some water!

30:25.100 --> 30:27.220
-Here, give it to me! -Get some more water.

30:27.220 --> 30:29.100
No, we need to find a way out of here.

30:29.100 --> 30:30.850
Or we'll be consumed by the demon fire.

30:30.850 --> 30:31.760
It doesn't work.

30:31.760 --> 30:33.010
Look at the aperture on the roof.

30:33.010 --> 30:33.660
The demon fire

30:33.660 --> 30:35.030
attached to the boundary of the Pearl Pavilion.

30:35.030 --> 30:37.070
There's no way a living thing can escape.

30:37.070 --> 30:38.200
What are we gonna do?

30:44.500 --> 30:44.990
Girl!

30:45.330 --> 30:46.360
I'll use my psychic powers

30:46.360 --> 30:47.570
to help you fight your way out.

30:47.570 --> 30:48.180
Otherwise, it'll be too late.

30:48.180 --> 30:48.910
What about you?

30:48.910 --> 30:49.800
Just leave me alone.

30:49.800 --> 30:50.710
I can't get out.

30:53.060 --> 30:54.220
Even if I can stop the fire,

30:54.220 --> 30:55.480
I can't get out of here.

30:55.740 --> 30:56.500
But you are different.

30:56.500 --> 30:57.830
You still have a chance.

31:03.340 --> 31:04.400
What are you doing?

31:11.380 --> 31:13.440
Senior Xueyang gave you this hairpin

31:13.900 --> 31:14.300
because

31:14.300 --> 31:17.630
this is the key to unlock the boundary of the Pearl Pavilion.

31:18.100 --> 31:20.030
You already knew that, didn't you?

31:22.660 --> 31:23.710
Give it back to me!

31:26.660 --> 31:27.660
If she were alive,

31:28.780 --> 31:30.580
she wouldn't need you to do this.

31:35.060 --> 31:36.320
But she's gone.

31:36.320 --> 31:37.990
She's gone!

31:39.060 --> 31:41.100
This hairpin is all I have.

31:41.100 --> 31:43.230
You're gonna take it away, too?

31:48.220 --> 31:48.840
Master!

31:49.140 --> 31:51.390
This... is the last thing she left me.

31:51.700 --> 31:54.830
I can't live without it.

32:07.980 --> 32:08.510
Liu Shao!

32:20.180 --> 32:20.640
Master.

32:21.340 --> 32:22.800
You can keep it if you want.

32:24.660 --> 32:25.110
But,

32:25.940 --> 32:27.030
we can't lose.

32:54.740 --> 32:55.270
This way!

32:55.500 --> 32:55.980
Get some more water!

32:55.980 --> 32:56.560
Lu Li.

32:56.560 --> 32:57.090
Liu Shao!

32:57.460 --> 32:58.070
Liu Shao!

32:58.500 --> 33:00.030
Are you in there? Answer me!

33:00.620 --> 33:01.290
Liu Shao!

33:01.290 --> 33:02.110
Not enough. Go get some more water!

33:02.110 --> 33:02.540
Okay! Coming!

33:02.540 --> 33:02.960
Here.

33:02.960 --> 33:03.300
Get another bucket!

33:03.300 --> 33:04.370
Lu Li, don't go!

33:04.370 --> 33:05.210
It's too dangerous!

33:05.210 --> 33:06.570
I just checked.

33:06.570 --> 33:08.030
There's nothing in there!

33:08.650 --> 33:09.320
Lu Li!

33:09.660 --> 33:10.590
Coming! Coming!

33:10.940 --> 33:11.550
Hurry up! Hurry up!

33:11.160 --> 33:13.140
[Pearl Pavilion]

33:14.860 --> 33:15.390
Hurry up!

33:27.940 --> 33:28.470
Liu Shao.

33:35.380 --> 33:35.910
Lu Li.

33:37.210 --> 33:38.470
Take me away.

33:42.980 --> 33:43.430
Okay.

33:44.860 --> 33:45.860
I'll take you out.

35:17.340 --> 35:18.500
I can't believe their psychic power

35:18.500 --> 35:20.070
radiates such power.

35:46.430 --> 35:51.310
[Pearl Pavilion]

36:13.770 --> 36:15.030
After all these years,

36:15.620 --> 36:16.950
you finally got over it.

36:17.180 --> 36:18.390
I dare not go out.

36:18.700 --> 36:20.430
I'm afraid if I walk out of here,

36:20.580 --> 36:22.040
I'll never feel you again.

36:23.140 --> 36:24.540
How could you not feel me?

36:25.340 --> 36:27.140
Aren't you the master of plants?

36:31.940 --> 36:33.270
The world in front of you

36:33.730 --> 36:35.130
is the one I used to guard.

36:36.180 --> 36:37.830
Every inch of the land

36:38.660 --> 36:40.460
has been filled with my efforts.

36:42.260 --> 36:43.150
Do you feel it?

36:46.340 --> 36:47.390
Yes, Xueyang.

36:50.980 --> 36:51.870
I feel it.

37:01.450 --> 37:05.110
But... I still miss you.

37:25.260 --> 37:26.060
The King Herb?

37:31.140 --> 37:31.940
The King Herb.

37:34.420 --> 37:34.950
Me?

37:44.740 --> 37:45.510
Master!

37:45.980 --> 37:47.310
-Your hair! -Your hair!

37:49.220 --> 37:50.420
You kept your promise

37:51.180 --> 37:53.020
and helped me out of the Pearl Pavilion.

37:53.020 --> 37:54.150
And I kept my promise

37:54.380 --> 37:55.980
to give you the immortal herb.

37:55.980 --> 37:57.110
But you...

37:59.500 --> 37:59.870
I...

38:00.260 --> 38:01.580
What are you talking about?

38:01.580 --> 38:03.040
Although my hair is white,

38:03.300 --> 38:04.070
I'm still

38:04.580 --> 38:05.950
a handsome master.

38:06.260 --> 38:06.710
Girl,

38:07.740 --> 38:08.800
help me put this on.

38:19.940 --> 38:20.670
Is it pretty?

38:22.570 --> 38:23.190
Yes.

38:25.460 --> 38:27.230
All good things must come to an end.

38:27.230 --> 38:27.950
This time

38:28.820 --> 38:29.880
I really should go.

38:30.860 --> 38:32.190
You two

38:32.500 --> 38:34.630
are gonna get really bored without me.

38:38.900 --> 38:40.230
You guys really miss me.

38:40.580 --> 38:42.340
If you don't want me to leave, just tell me.

38:42.340 --> 38:44.140
But even if tell me, I won't stay.

38:45.500 --> 38:45.990
Master,

38:46.420 --> 38:47.550
where are you going?

38:48.700 --> 38:50.360
Go back to my immortal palace.

38:50.580 --> 38:51.470
It's kind of

38:51.860 --> 38:52.670
back to

38:53.380 --> 38:54.380
where I came from.

38:55.180 --> 38:56.310
So will we

38:56.700 --> 38:57.910
see each other again?

38:58.500 --> 38:59.110
Girl,

38:59.860 --> 39:01.600
you have Lu Li with you.

39:01.600 --> 39:02.730
You won't be lonely.

39:03.580 --> 39:04.910
As long as we are bonded,

39:05.380 --> 39:06.440
we will meet again.

39:07.300 --> 39:07.670
Bye.

39:34.450 --> 39:36.920
[Imperial Cosmo Hall]

39:45.380 --> 39:46.580
What's going on here?

39:48.090 --> 39:50.390
I was gone for a day or two.

39:51.260 --> 39:53.100
Such a big thing happened.

39:53.100 --> 39:55.700
The Pearl Pavilion has stood

39:55.700 --> 39:57.830
for thousands of years in the mansion.

39:57.860 --> 39:59.190
How could it catch fire?

40:05.780 --> 40:06.710
Tell me!

40:10.300 --> 40:11.270
Tell me!

40:13.020 --> 40:14.340
I think there must be some disciples

40:14.340 --> 40:16.310
accidentally knocked over the demon-banishing lights.

40:16.310 --> 40:17.770
That's how it caught fire.

40:23.340 --> 40:25.030
I heard it was a demon fire.

40:25.660 --> 40:27.070
And it never goes out.

40:30.020 --> 40:30.600
My Lord.

40:30.900 --> 40:31.800
I can testify that

40:31.800 --> 40:33.260
it was indeed a demon fire.

40:33.260 --> 40:35.230
The fire can't be put out by water.

40:35.980 --> 40:37.170
The other day in the fire,

40:37.170 --> 40:38.750
I found a grass demon.

40:38.750 --> 40:40.480
It should be made of King Herbs.

40:41.100 --> 40:42.070
I heard that

40:42.740 --> 40:43.860
Junior Liu Shao

40:43.860 --> 40:46.180
has been hanging out at the Pearl Pavilion lately.

40:46.180 --> 40:48.790
She's probably looking for the herb, too.

40:48.790 --> 40:50.190
Where is that herb demon?

40:50.260 --> 40:51.180
The grass demon

40:51.180 --> 40:53.110
disappeared after the fire.

40:53.500 --> 40:54.750
My guess is that

40:55.060 --> 40:57.190
he was trapped in the Pearl Pavilion.

40:57.780 --> 40:59.450
He wanted to escape,

40:59.450 --> 41:01.150
so he started the fire.

41:01.150 --> 41:03.380
Junior Bai's inference made perfect sense.

41:03.380 --> 41:03.990
I

41:04.180 --> 41:05.390
think so too.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.520
Shameless.

41:07.520 --> 41:08.450
I heard

41:08.450 --> 41:11.510
that the grass demon and Liu Shao are very personal friends.

41:11.510 --> 41:12.340
When he left,

41:12.340 --> 41:15.140
he had handed over the King Herb to Junior Liu Shao.

41:20.940 --> 41:21.470
Liu Shao.

41:35.940 --> 41:37.620
Liu Shao did get the herb.

41:37.620 --> 41:40.880
She's waiting for Your Majesty to come back and present it.

41:43.580 --> 41:44.670
She got it?

41:45.660 --> 41:47.340
Liu Shao is so amazing.

41:47.340 --> 41:49.000
She's not the average person.

42:26.820 --> 42:28.280
It really is the King Herb.

42:29.660 --> 42:33.060
It seems that heaven is not gonna kill me and there's a way out.

42:41.340 --> 42:42.070
Liu Shao.

42:47.460 --> 42:48.270
This time,

42:49.140 --> 42:50.590
you've done a great job.

42:57.980 --> 42:59.440
What about the demon fire?

43:00.420 --> 43:01.740
Now that you've got the herb,

43:01.740 --> 43:03.200
you redeemed yourselves.

43:03.340 --> 43:05.640
I will let go of the burning of the Pearl Pavilion.
